></name><name><surname>Baur</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Herter</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kr&#x000fc;ger</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Breul</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Keller</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Hombach</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A perfused renal human organ culture model: impact of monocyte attack</article-title><source>Med Sci Monit</source><year>2007</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>CR82</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17261987</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>